Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time you made a real decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've left my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd probably have done it even if I hadn't met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're the one who made me take the step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I want to push you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want you to choose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose to be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose to take the leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose to be mine, fully and completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going down to get the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you've decided when I come back.
